OL,3,GNEWSAMPs demand meeting with water
OL,4,Achief over outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MPs have written to Anglian
OL,7,FWater demanding an urgent meeting
OL,8,Ffollowing what they described as "a
OL,9,Fweek of major water supply failures"
OL,10,Facross Norfolk.
OL,12,FBen Goldsborough of South Norfolk,
OL,13,FTerry Jermy of South West Norfolk,
OL,14,FAlice Macdonald of Norwich North and
OL,15,FClive Lewis of Norwich South have
OL,16,Fcalled for a meeting in Westminster
OL,17,Fwith chief executive Mark Thurston.
OL,19,FIn their letter, they cited outages
OL,20,Ffrom 16 November, claiming "thousands
OL,21,Fof households" were left without water.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
