OL,3,GNEWSAMPs demand meeting with water
OL,4,Achief over outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has apologised, saying two
OL,7,Fevents on 17 and 20 November had halted
OL,8,Fsupplies or caused a loss of pressure,
OL,9,Fbut that it was "inaccurate" to say
OL,10,Fcustomers were left without water for a
OL,11,Fprolonged period.
